{"id":"ab2c4056d8d6b76e","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-completeness.md","title":"Completeness","display":"df-completeness — Completeness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-completeness","aliases":["93-df-completeness"],"display":"df-completeness — Completeness","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","[[93-df-semantic-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-completeness — Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"84c35fea1e867240\" href=\"?note=84c35fea1e867240\" title=\"93-df-first-order-formula\">93-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b587d680bb02f51\" href=\"?note=8b587d680bb02f51\" title=\"93-df-semantic-consequence\">93-df-semantic-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(F=\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\">\\(\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\)</span> is a calculus consequence relation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> is a class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-structures; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L}\\)</span> are the structure class and semantic consequence relation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b587d680bb02f51\" href=\"?note=8b587d680bb02f51\" title=\"93-df-semantic-consequence\">93-df-semantic-consequence</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}_{93}(\\vdash,\\mathcal K;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\vdash\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L))\\times\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n(\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\to\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}_{93}(\\vdash,\\mathcal K;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\vdash\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L))\\times\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n(\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\to\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The calculus relation, model class, and first-order language are all arguments. The displayed direction is completeness; its converse is soundness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"84c35fea1e867240","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-semantic-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"8b587d680bb02f51","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-semantic-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-semantic-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"8b587d680bb02f51","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal K$ is a class of $\\mathcal L$-structures; $\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)$ and $\\models_{\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L}$ are the structure class and semantic consequence relation of [[93-df-semantic-consequence]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}_{93}(\\vdash,\\mathcal K;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\vdash\\;\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L))\\times\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n(\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathcal K,\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\to\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1442,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["84c35fea1e867240","8b587d680bb02f51"]}